# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file"). Save checks P5.3 and P5.4
# (port/test/README.md, "Save checks"; port/test/tools/savechk.sh). Hand-made from frame dumps
# of the played build, not from a TAS.
# Late-game save check, session 2 (and the P5.4-style cross-machine sessions). Start: the save late_bt8_k1.keys leaves (Tower of Valni floor 8, chapterIndex 43, turn 1, Eirika has waited, a map-menu suspend). Resume Chapter (a suspend save), A on grey Eirika: the map menu, End: the enemy phase (no battles: the enemies move, from tick 2,150 on the PC), turn 2's player phase (from tick 2,700 on the PC; suspend saves).
# 4500 ticks; each press is held 2 ticks. The played builds take it as FE8PC_KEYSCRIPT
# (port/test/tools/keys_to_keyscript.py; frame N is tick N on the lag-free PC).
#
000*250
001*2      # 250: A, health and safety
000*748
008*2      # 1000: Start, skip the opening
000*298
001*2      # 1300: A, title: the title menu
000*198
001*2      # 1500: A, Resume Chapter: the slot list
000*198
001*2      # 1700: A, resume (the cursor on grey Eirika)
000*198
001*2      # 1900: A on grey Eirika: the map menu (Unit ... Suspend, End)
000*98
040*2      # 2000: Up, wraps to End
000*98
001*2      # 2100: A, End: the enemy phase
000*2398
